Yama mounts death chariot with Death and Time staff --- Rakshasa ministers flee in terror --- Yama and Ravana duel seven nights undecided --- Ravana wounds Death driver and Yama with arrows --- Yama exhales anger fire and Death begs release --- Yama lifts infallible Kala staff --- Brahma forbids strike to guard his boon --- Yama withdraws to heaven while Ravana exits proclaiming victory
